Made by gen_openalex.py (in the bulk-rs fixture generators): 20 synthetic works, as API JSON lines (works.jsonl) and as one Parquet file in the works snapshot's schema with 8-row row groups (part_0000.parquet); held.tsv holds one PMCID, one PMID and one DOI as pmc-pmids --ids-out writes them. Cases: a kept work, French, 19 citations, no DOI, an arXiv location, held by PMCID, PMID and DOI (in another case), retracted, paratext, a short abstract, a repeated position, an Abstract label with a copyright line, a SUMMARY label with a nameless author and a twice-named institution, no primary location with a one-page range and no date, a repeated DOI, no abstract, no title, no source, authors or locations, and a lowercase word after Summary.
